WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.368
For bigger jobs, put a whole team on it. Workflows wires your agents together: who plans, who builds, and who checks the work.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:12.591
When a check fails, the work loops back to be fixed, until everything passes.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:18.669
Not sure your team is ready? Press Test, for a tiny practice build that proves it works, start to finish.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:28.080
Then tell the team what to build, and press Start. Each step hands its work to the next, live.
